WEBVTT

00:14:57.232 --> 00:15:01.468
ilaa aan kahool gabo.

00:15:01.468 --> 00:15:03.688
Aad baad umahadsan tihiin , shirkana kuwada damaashaada.

00:15:03.688 --> 00:15:08.257
Mahadsanidiin. Mahadsanidiin, Mahadsanidiin. (Sacbis)

00:15:08.257 --> 00:15:11.108
Mahadsanidiin. Mahadsanidiin, Mahadsanidiin.

00:15:11.108 --> 00:15:13.476
Mahadsanidiin.

00:15:14.995 --> 00:15:18.697
Horay usoco! (Sacbis)